<%# The figure of the error pages (break), engraved by Score's own engraver
    and kept as it drew it: no engine, no database, no script at request time
    (a 5xx page must not lean on what may have failed). A held note, a double bar, then a bar's rest: the intermission.
    Its source, drawn again with ScoreSvg.draw(source, 320, 7, 0, {}) when the
    engraver's drawing changes:
      \relative c'' { \time 4/4 g2-- r2 \bar "||" r1 \bar "|." } -%>
